  "body": "The WhatWG page on [Node::getRootNode](https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#interface-node) states that this function returns an object of type `Node`. Yet, shouldn't it state, instead, that this function returns an object of type `ShadowRoot`?\r\n\r\nThe `Node` interface lacks, for instance, the [`host`](https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#interface-shadowroot) property, which is documented to be a property of the return value of `Node::getRootNode()`.\r\n\r\n/see also: /mdn/sprints/issues/1204",
